在《Belly Full of Turkey》中，您会听到歌曲 Mr. Roboto，这是一首在脱衣舞俱乐部播放的搞笑歌曲。

00:24:44.059 --> 00:24:45.859
I just love that I'm on Thanksgiving.
我很高兴我在感恩节。

00:24:45.859 --> 00:24:47.900
That's the song she's dancing on a strip club.
这是她在脱衣舞俱乐部跳舞的歌曲。

00:24:47.900 --> 00:25:02.799
And the idea was gonna be that we would then, At the end of the episode have the sweet touching song be like this really sort of indie rock acoustic slow emotional version of Mr. Roboto and the 88 who are awesome dudes said we'll make that for you.
我们的想法是，在这一集的结尾，我们会播放一首甜美动人的歌曲，就像这首独立摇滚原声缓慢情感版本的 Roboto 先生和 88 位很棒的家伙说我们会为你制作这首歌曲。

00:25:02.799 --> 00:25:03.799
That's hilarious.
太搞笑了。

00:25:03.799 --> 00:25:04.799
We'll do it.
我们会做的。

00:25:04.799 --> 00:25:08.660
And they made like actually a really moving pretty sounding version of Mr. Roboto.
他们实际上制作了一个非常动人、声音优美的机器人先生版本。

00:25:08.660 --> 00:25:09.819
Chris says about it.
克里斯谈到了这一点。

00:25:09.819 --> 00:25:18.019
The craziest thing is because of the Mr. Roboto reference earlier we all thought it would be cool to get the 88 to cover Mr. Roboto final scene Adam and Keith who run that band I think did it.
最疯狂的事情是因为早些时候提到了 Mr. Roboto，我们都认为让 88 来覆盖 Mr. Roboto 最后的场景会很酷，我认为他们是那个乐队的运营者 Adam 和 Keith。

00:25:18.019 --> 00:25:25.779
And it's awesome, but ultimately their song You Belong To Me was more emotional, but I always regret we didn't get to unleash a cover on the world.
这太棒了，但最终他们的歌曲《你属于我》更加情绪化，但我总是很遗憾我们没有向世界公开翻唱。

00:25:25.779 --> 00:25:28.819
I still haven't and use it in playlists sometimes.
我仍然没有使用它，有时会在播放列表中使用它。

00:25:28.819 --> 00:25:29.819
Thank you.
谢谢。

00:25:29.819 --> 00:25:35.410
Yes, and thank you Chris Miller for sending us all of that, and we've got a few more questions answered.
是的，感谢克里斯·米勒向我们发送所有这些信息，我们还得到了其他一些问题的答案。

